// A sibling of the scenario's designated file, swept into the root module by
// being in its folder. Nothing here changed when submodules arrived: a subfolder
// that holds no designated file is organisational, and a file beside the
// designated one is the enclosing module's, which is what the folder sweep
// already did.

fn perimeter(w i64, h i64) i64 {
  (w + h) * 2i64;
}
